# kin/child/wear/tile_checks: the child's checks pattern (a fine check): a tile laid over the garment's cloth in the pattern
# slot, the cloth's shading kept (tags tile; doll.h). Child-sized: the adult's period halved where it would crowd 6 rows.
use person
body child
role overlay checks
legend X pattern 2
layer torso
anchor neck
keys rest
tags tile

view D key rest origin 0 0
